<widget>
    <div class="docs-home">
        <section class="docs-hero">
            <h1 class="docs-hero-title">VOA</h1>
            <p class="docs-hero-subtitle">Valkyrie Omni App Framework</p>
            <p class="docs-hero-desc">纯 GGScript + AWSL 的全栈框架，类似 Next.js 但不写一行 C#</p>
            <div class="docs-hero-actions">
                <Link href="/docs/getting-started">
                    <Button variant="primary" size="large" label="快速开始 →" />
                </Link>
                <Link href="/tutorial">
                    <Button variant="outline" size="large" label="交互式教程" />
                </Link>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="docs-features">
            <div class="docs-feature-grid">
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>🗺️ 文件系统路由</h3>
                    <p>pages/ 目录即路由，支持动态参数和 Catch-all</p>
                </Card>
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>🎨 四种渲染模式</h3>
                    <p>CSR / SSR / SSG / ISR 按路由配置</p>
                </Card>
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>⚡ 响应式 Effect</h3>
                    <p>useState / useEffect / useMemo / createSignal</p>
                </Card>
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>🛡️ 中间件管道</h3>
                    <p>洋葱模型 + CORS / JWT / RateLimit</p>
                </Card>
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>🔄 HMR 热替换</h3>
                    <p>Widget / 脚本 / 样式三级热更新 &lt; 200ms</p>
                </Card>
                <Card variant="bordered">
                    <h3>☁️ 多平台部署</h3>
                    <p>OlympCloud / Vercel / Netlify / CF Pages</p>
                </Card>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="docs-stats">
            <div class="docs-stat-item">
                <span class="docs-stat-value">{totalComponents}</span>
                <span class="docs-stat-label">组件</span>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-stat-item">
                <span class="docs-stat-value">{totalApis}</span>
                <span class="docs-stat-label">API 函数</span>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-stat-item">
                <span class="docs-stat-value">11</span>
                <span class="docs-stat-label">包</span>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-stat-item">
                <span class="docs-stat-value">4</span>
                <span class="docs-stat-label">渲染模式</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</widget>

<script>
    let totalComponents = get_total_component_count()
    let totalApis = get_total_api_count()
</script>

<style>
.docs-home { }
.docs-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 0 48px;
}
.docs-hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--voa-accent), var(--voa-success));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
.docs-hero-subtitle {
    margin: 8px 0 4px;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--voa-text-secondary);
}
.docs-hero-desc {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--voa-text-tertiary);
}
.docs-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
}
.docs-feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
}
.docs-feature-grid h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 15px;
}
.docs-feature-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--voa-text-secondary);
}
.docs-stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--voa-border);
}
.docs-stat-item {
    text-align: center;
}
.docs-stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--voa-accent);
}
.docs-stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--voa-text-secondary);
}
</style>
